glibc: undefined symbol is Load_defect: true
dyld: symbol not found in flat namespace is Load_defect: true
glibc: a missing dependency, the library present is Load_defect: true
dyld: a missing dependency, the library present is Load_defect: true
dyld: signature not valid, load disallowed by system policy is Code_signing_refusal: true
dyld: missing code signature is Code_signing_refusal: true
dyld: a signing refusal, the library gone since is Code_signing_refusal: true
glibc: the library itself missing is Library_missing: true
dyld: the library itself missing is Library_missing: true
LoadLibrary: the library itself missing is Library_missing: true
Load_defect raises severity Compiler_bug
Code_signing_refusal raises severity Environment
Library_missing raises severity Environment
some case is a signing refusal: true
some case is a missing library: true
some case is a link defect: true
a library that loads is loaded once, without a pause: true
a signing refusal that clears loads on the one retry, after one pause: true
a signing refusal that persists is refused after exactly one retry: true
a retry refused for another reason is classified by the retry's own dlerror: true
a link defect is not retried: true
a missing library is not retried: true
a real signing refusal, its library re-signed in place, loads on the retry: true
a real signing refusal that persists is refused again on the retry: true
